|leveling4    = {{st|Minimum Physical Damage|{{ap|150 to 450}} {{as|(+ 60% '''bonus''' AD)}}|Maximum Physical Damage|{{ap|400 to 1200}} {{as|(+ 120% '''bonus''' AD)}}}}
